  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "After a while, your vehicle may have difficulty climbing the bridge. First wash the O-rings in warm soapy water. The O-rings are dust magnets and will need to be cleaned every now and again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Turning the lights off will help the batteries last longer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "If the wheels spin in the wrong direction, simply rotate the motor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Each kit contains all the parts you need to complete one car model."
